<!DOCTYPE html
    PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html dir="ltr" lang="en">

<head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
    <meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting" />
</head>
<style>
    strong {
        color: #2B7FFF;
    }
</style>

<body
    style='background-color:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;'>
    <table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"
        style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 0 48px">
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>
                    <img alt="{{saasName}}" src="https://pub-91723ae32b5f4bc88cd11d3b390c75ba.r2.dev/Weats%20icon%20Files-01.svg"
                        style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;border-radius:1.5rem;width:85px;height:85px" />

                    <h1
                        style="font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-0.5px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:rgb(72,72,72);padding-top:24px;margin:0;">
                        QR Identifier Delivery 📦
                    </h1>

                    <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:20px 0;color:#3c4149;">
                        Dear partner,<br /><br />
                        We would like to inform you that the generation process for the digital identifiers for
                        <strong>{{establishmentName}}</strong> has been successfully completed.<br /><br />
                        These resources have been configured to optimize service at your venue, ensuring a direct
                        connection between the customer and the respective service point.
                    </p>

                    <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                        style="background-color:#f8fafc; border-radius:10px; margin:24px 0; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding:24px; text-align:center;">
                                <p
                                    style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:13px; color:#64748b; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px; font-weight:600;">
                                    Total QR Codes Generated</p>
                                <h2 style="margin:0; font-size:32px; color:#2B7FFF; font-weight:700;">{{qrCodesCount}}
                                </h2>
                                <p style="margin:8px 0 0 0; font-size:14px; color:#475569;">File:
                                    <strong>{{establishmentName}}.zip</strong>
                                </p>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>

                    <div style="margin-bottom:32px;">
                        <h3
                            style="font-size:15px; color:#1e293b; border-bottom:1px solid #eaeaea; padding-bottom:10px; margin-bottom:15px;">
                            Distribution by Service Zone</h3>
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                            style="font-size:15px; color:#475569; line-height:1.6;">
                            {{#each serviceZones}}
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding:8px 0;">📍 {{this.zoneName}}</td>
                                <td align="right" style="padding:8px 0;"><strong>{{this.count}} units</strong></td>
                            </tr>
                            {{/each}}
                            <tr>
                                <td colspan="2"
                                    style="padding-top:15px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; color:#64748b; border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;">
                                    <br />
                                    <strong>Technical Note:</strong> The attached files are in high resolution. We
                                    recommend printing on durable materials with a matte finish to ensure optimal
                                    optical scanning across different lighting conditions.
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </div>


                    <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 20px;color:#64748b;">
                        The QR Codes are attached to this email. If you notice any data discrepancies or require
                        technical support during implementation, our support team is at your disposal.
                    </p>

                    <hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:32px 0 24px" />

                    <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="color:#b4becc;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;">
                                <strong>{{saasName}} Solutions</strong><br />
                                Customer Support and Operations Department.<br />
                                <a href="https://dash.weats.app" style="color:#2B7FFF;text-decoration:none;"
                                    target="_blank">Documentation and Support</a>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</body>

</html>